# Three real tools per Linux x86_64 test image.
# `just test-prepare` downloads each one and refuses a checksum mismatch.
#
# One `name release-tag sha256` per line; test/prepare.sh knows where each
# tool's archive lives. Renovate updates tag and checksum from the comment
# above the line. nono and Codex use musl builds; OpenCode uses its glibc
# baseline build, with runtime libraries installed by test/install-deps.sh.

